# auth/

Auth feature scaffolding for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Stamped because the project
was scaffolded with `--with-auth`.

This is a **placeholder** — the only files inside the four subfolders are
`.gitkeep`s. Fill in:

- `components/SignInForm.tsx`
- `hooks/useAuthSession.ts`
- `services/auth.service.ts`
- `types/auth.types.ts`

…and register the sign-in screen in
[`../../navigation/RootNavigator.tsx`](../../navigation/RootNavigator.tsx).

## What does NOT live here

- Token storage primitives — those live in `${SRC_DIR}/lib/storage.ts`.
- Generic API client — that lives in `${SRC_DIR}/api/`.

